  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Extractives Global Programmatic Support Single-Donor Trust Fund (EGPS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to Extractive Global Programmatic Support multi-donor trust fund (EGPS-MDTF). The EGPS-MDTF will provide continuity to the goals achieved by the EITI-MDTF and will increase its effectiveness by expanding the scope of the EITI concept into sector transparency, reinforcing legal and regulatory support to countries to enable better transactions and contracts, enhancing donor coordination and improving synergies across partners and respective portfolios.</narrative>
  </description>
